[ Dopamine deficiency syndrome is a rare condition that affects a child’s
ability to move their body and muscles. Here’s what you should know.
](https://www.healthline.com/health/dopamine-deficiency?utm_source=ReadNext)

Research has found that meditation can help [ increase your dopamine levels
](https://www.healthline.com/nutrition/how-to-increase-dopamine/) (  [ 34
](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/31166449/) ).

[ Sleep hygiene ](https://www.healthline.com/nutrition/17-tips-to-sleep-
better) can be improved by sleeping and waking at the same time each day,
reducing noise in your bedroom, avoiding [ caffeine
](https://www.healthline.com/health/food-nutrition/quitting-caffeine-
benefits/) in the evening, and using your bed only for sleeping (  [ 29
](https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/labs/pmc/articles/PMC4400203/) ).

